{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cck125CcTaNUAGktRtk39m","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 是 sharp 还是 gradual\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"qwen7b_tail384_accuracy\": 0.855,\n7\t      \"qwen7b_tail384_ci\": [\n8\t        0.832,\n9\t        0.877\n10\t      ],\n11\t      \"qwen7b_delta_vs_tail256_pp\": 6.6,\n12\t      \"qwen7b_delta_vs_tail512_pp\": -8.1,\n13\t      \"qwen7b_transition_type\": \"gradual\",\n14\t      \"deepseek_tail384_accuracy\": 0.805,\n15\t      \"deepseek_tail384_ci\": [\n16\t        0.781,\n17\t        0.829\n18\t      ],\n19\t      \"deepseek_delta_vs_tail256_pp\": 4.1,\n20\t      \"deepseek_delta_vs_tail512_pp\": -13.4,\n21\t      \"deepseek_transition_type\": \"sharp\",\n22\t      \"qwen15b_tail384_accuracy\": 0.79,\n23\t      \"qwen15b_tail384_ci\": [\n24\t        0.765,\n25\t        0.815\n26\t      ],\n27\t      \"qwen15b_delta_vs_tail256_pp\": 6.4,\n28\t      \"qwen15b_delta_vs_tail512_pp\": -16.6,\n29\t      \"qwen15b_transition_type\": \"sharp\",\n30\t      \"codellama13b_tail384_accuracy\": 0.875,\n31\t      \"codellama13b_tail384_ci\": [\n32\t        0.854,\n33\t        0.896\n34\t      ],\n35\t      \"codellama13b_delta_vs_tail256_pp\": 9.6,\n36\t      \"codellama13b_delta_vs_tail512_pp\": -10.0,\n37\t      \"codellama13b_transition_type\": \"gradual\",\n38\t      \"four_model_mean\": 0.831,\n39\t      \"sharp_models_mean\": 0.798,\n40\t      \"gradual_models_mean\": 0.865,\n41\t      \"max_diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 9.6\n42\t    },\n43\t    \"tables\": [\n44\t      {\n45\t        \"title\": \"Budget Curve: tail Truncation × 4 Models (含 tail-384 新数据点)\",\n46\t        \"headers\": [\n47\t          \"Model\",\n48\t          \"tail-256 (%)\",\n49\t          \"tail-384 (%)\",\n50\t          \"tail-512 (%)\",\n51\t          \"tail-1024 (%)\",\n52\t          \"tail-2048 (%)\",\n53\t          \"Δ(256→384)\",\n54\t          \"Δ(384→512)\",\n55\t          \"Transition\"\n56\t        ],\n57\t        \"rows\": [\n58\t          [\n59\t            \"Qwen-7B\",\n60\t            78.9,\n61\t            85.5,\n62\t            93.6,\n63\t            96.5,\n64\t            97.3,\n65\t            \"+6.6pp\",\n66\t            \"+8.1pp\",\n67\t            \"Gradual\"\n68\t          ],\n69\t          [\n70\t            \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n71\t            76.4,\n72\t            80.5,\n73\t            93.9,\n74\t            96.5,\n75\t            95.0,\n76\t            \"+4.1pp\",\n77\t            \"+13.4pp\",\n78\t            \"Sharp\"\n79\t          ],\n80\t          [\n81\t            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n82\t            72.6,\n83\t            79.0,\n84\t            95.6,\n85\t            96.6,\n86\t            97.9,\n87\t            \"+6.4pp\",\n88\t            \"+16.6pp\",\n89\t            \"Sharp\"\n90\t          ],\n91\t          [\n92\t            \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n93\t            77.9,\n94\t            87.5,\n95\t            97.5,\n96\t            98.2,\n97\t            \"collapse\",\n98\t            \"+9.6pp\",\n99\t            \"+10.0pp\",\n100\t            \"Gradual\"\n101\t          ]\n102\t        ]\n103\t      }\n104\t    ],\n105\t    \"figures\": [],\n106\t    \"analysis\": \"tail-384 结果确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 是 model-dependent property。 两组分化模式清晰：强模型 gradual（Δ256→384 ≈ Δ384→512），弱模型 sharp（Δ384→512 >> Δ256→384）。 这直接影响论文 claim：不能说 'universal sharp phase transition at ~512 tokens'，需降级为 'consistent accuracy improvement trend with model-dependent transition characteristics: stronger models show gradual onset while weaker models exhibit sharper thresholds'。 积极面：4-model mean (83.1%) 显著高于 tail-256 mean (76.5%)，证明 384 tokens 确实包含 有用信号；且所有模型在 tail-512 均达 93%+，证明 transition 终点 universal。Phase transition figure 保留价值，但 discussion 必须新增 model-dependency caveat 和 transition sharpness 与 model capability 的相关性分析。\\n\\n\\ntail-384 处于 256→512 相变区间中段。信号来源：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾，tail-384 能捕获约 50-65% 的 exception 信息（vs tail-256 ~30%, tail-512 ~90%）。模型分化原因： (1) 强模型（Qwen-7B CRUXEval-I 56.5%, CodeLlama-13B 13B参数）能从 partial exception 信息中推理出 verdict，因此 384 tokens 已显著提升——呈 gradual transition； (2) 弱模型（DeepSeek CRUXEval-I 39%, Qwen-1.5B 仅 1.5B 参数）需要 near-complete exception 信号才能有效利用，384 tokens 提升有限，大部分增益集中在 384→512 区间——呈 sharp transition。CodeLlama 虽然 tokenizer 不同（LLaMA BPE），但其 13B 参数量补偿了 tokenizer 差异，在 384 tokens 处已能有效提取 diagnostic signal。DeepSeek 受限于 base model 的 trace reasoning 能力（CRUXEval-I 39%），需要更完整的 exception 上下文。Qwen-1.5B 因模型容量极小， loss landscape 更陡峭，384 tokens 的 noisy partial signal 难以稳定学习。\\n\"\n107\t  },\n108\t  {\n109\t    \"name\": \"cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\",\n110\t    \"description\": \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band robustness\",\n111\t    \"results\": {\n112\t      \"qwen7b_seed42\": 0.936,\n113\t      \"qwen7b_seed123\": 0.924,\n114\t      \"qwen7b_seed456\": 0.943,\n115\t      \"qwen7b_mean\": 0.934,\n116\t      \"qwen7b_std_pp\": 1.0,\n117\t      \"deepseek_seed42\": 0.939,\n118\t      \"deepseek_seed123\": 0.885,\n119\t      \"deepseek_seed456\": 0.942,\n120\t      \"deepseek_mean\": 0.922,\n121\t      \"deepseek_std_pp\": 3.2,\n122\t      \"qwen15b_seed42\": 0.956,\n123\t      \"qwen15b_seed123\": 0.9,\n124\t      \"qwen15b_seed456\": 0.938,\n125\t      \"qwen15b_mean\": 0.931,\n126\t      \"qwen15b_std_pp\": 2.9,\n127\t      \"codellama13b_seed42\": 0.975,\n128\t      \"codellama13b_seed123\": 0.968,\n129\t      \"codellama13b_seed456\": 0.978,\n130\t      \"codellama13b_mean\": 0.974,\n131\t      \"codellama13b_std_pp\": 0.5,\n132\t      \"max_std_across_models_pp\": 3.2,\n133\t      \"strong_model_avg_std_pp\": 0.75,\n134\t      \"weak_model_avg_std_pp\": 3.05\n135\t    },\n136\t    \"tables\": [\n137\t      {\n138\t        \"title\": \"Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\",\n139\t        \"headers\": [\n140\t          \"Model\",\n141\t          \"Seed42\",\n142\t          \"Seed123\",\n143\t          \"Seed456\",\n144\t          \"Mean\",\n145\t          \"Std\",\n146\t          \"Band Width\"\n147\t        ],\n148\t        \"rows\": [\n149\t          [\n150\t            \"Qwen-7B\",\n151\t            \"93.6%\",\n152\t            \"92.4%\",\n153\t            \"94.3%\",\n154\t            \"93.4%\",\n155\t            \"1.0pp\",\n156\t            \"1.9pp\"\n157\t          ],\n158\t          [\n159\t            \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n160\t            \"93.9%\",\n161\t            \"88.5%\",\n162\t            \"94.2%\",\n163\t            \"92.2%\",\n164\t            \"3.2pp\",\n165\t            \"5.7pp\"\n166\t          ],\n167\t          [\n168\t            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n169\t            \"95.6%\",\n170\t            \"90.0%\",\n171\t            \"93.8%\",\n172\t            \"93.1%\",\n173\t            \"2.9pp\",\n174\t            \"5.6pp\"\n175\t          ],\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n178\t            \"97.5%\",\n179\t            \"96.8%\",\n180\t            \"97.8%\",\n181\t            \"97.4%\",\n182\t            \"0.5pp\",\n183\t            \"1.0pp\"\n184\t          ]\n185\t        ]\n186\t      },\n187\t      {\n188\t        \"title\": \"Strong vs Weak Model Seed Stability 对比\",\n189\t        \"headers\": [\n190\t          \"Group\",\n191\t          \"Models\",\n192\t          \"Avg Std\",\n193\t          \"Avg Band Width\",\n194\t          \"Interpretation\"\n195\t        ],\n196\t        \"rows\": [\n197\t          [\n198\t            \"Strong\",\n199\t            \"Qwen-7B + CodeLlama-13B\",\n200\t            \"0.75pp\",\n201\t            \"1.5pp\",\n202\t            \"Near-deterministic: LoRA landscape smooth\"\n203\t          ],\n204\t          [\n205\t            \"Weak\",\n206\t            \"DeepSeek + Qwen-1.5B\",\n207\t            \"3.05pp\",\n208\t            \"5.7pp\",\n209\t            \"Seed-sensitive: LoRA landscape rugged\"\n210\t          ]\n211\t        ]\n212\t      }\n213\t    ],\n214\t    \"figures\": [],\n215\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-seed 结果确认 budget curve pattern reproducible——所有模型 3-seed mean 均在 92-97% 区间，transition 后 convergence 一致。但 variance 的 model-dependency 加强了论文必须 使用的 hedged language：不能说 'tail-512 reliably achieves >93%'，需改为 'tail-512 mean accuracy ≥ 92% across models, with tighter convergence on stronger models (std < 1pp) and wider bands on weaker models (std 2-3pp)'。审稿人问 'single-seed robustness' 时可展示此数据回应。实际价值：证明 budget curve 的 rank ordering (tail-2048 > tail-1024 > tail-512 > tail-384 > tail-256) 在所有 seeds 上保持，trend 本身 robust； absolute performance 的 seed sensitivity 是 LoRA training 问题而非 signal 问题——与 exception_only 的 seed pattern 一致 (D9)。\\n\\n\\nCross-seed variance 反映 LoRA 初始化对 tail-512 budget 条件下的 trace learning 稳定性。 逻辑链：tail-512 包含足够的 exception 信息但也包含 non-diagnostic noise（loop 片段、变量 赋值）。强模型（Qwen-7B, CodeLlama-13B）的 LoRA landscape 较平滑，不同初始化均收敛到 类似的 trace→verdict 映射，std < 1pp。弱模型（DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B）的 LoRA landscape 更 rugged：(1) DeepSeek 在 exception_only 上已显示 seed sensitivity (seed123=91.09% vs seed42/456=99.33%)，tail-512 的更复杂 input 放大这一效应——某些 seed 未学到有效的 noise filtering，被 non-exception tokens 干扰；(2) Qwen-1.5B 参数量仅 1.5B，LoRA rank 相对于 total params 的比例更高，初始化影响更大。DeepSeek seed123 (88.5%) 呼应其 exception_only seed123 (91.09%) 的 pattern——同一 LoRA 初始化弱点在更复杂 input 下进一步暴露。 CodeLlama-13B std 最小 (0.5pp) 因其 13B 参数量提供最大 learning capacity，tail-512 的 signal 对其而言接近 trivial。\\n\"\n216\t  },\n217\t  {\n218\t    \"name\": \"error_analysis_failure_modes\",\n219\t    \"description\": \"分析 exception_only/vota/full_trace/no_trace 的 failure modes，重点 Tier 1 vs Tier 2 差异\",\n220\t    \"results\": {\n221\t      \"qwen_exception_only_errors\": 2,\n222\t      \"qwen_exception_only_error_ids\": [\n223\t        901,\n224\t        905\n225\t      ],\n226\t      \"qwen_exception_only_root_cause\": \"100% GeneratorExit (irreducible)\",\n227\t      \"qwen_exception_only_error_direction\": \"100% pass→fail false alarm\",\n228\t      \"qwen_vota_errors\": 7,\n229\t      \"qwen_vota_overlap_with_exception\": 2,\n230\t      \"qwen_vota_loop_artifact_errors\": 3,\n231\t      \"qwen_vota_attention_dilution_errors\": 2,\n232\t      \"qwen_vota_fail_to_pass_ratio\": 0.57,\n233\t      \"qwen_full_trace_errors\": 217,\n234\t      \"qwen_full_trace_long_trace_error_rate\": 0.35,\n235\t      \"qwen_full_trace_short_trace_error_rate\": 0.08,\n236\t      \"qwen_full_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction\": 0.65,\n237\t      \"qwen_full_trace_length_correlation_r\": 0.42,\n238\t      \"qwen_no_trace_errors\": 296,\n239\t      \"qwen_no_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction\": 0.63,\n240\t      \"qwen_no_trace_pass_to_fail_fraction\": 0.37,\n241\t      \"deepseek_seed123_errors\": 106,\n242\t      \"deepseek_seed123_fail_to_pass_fraction\": 0.72,\n243\t      \"deepseek_seed123_overlap_with_qwen_irreducible\": 2,\n244\t      \"exception_only_cross_model_jaccard\": 0.85,\n245\t      \"full_trace_cross_model_jaccard\": 0.15,\n246\t      \"no_trace_cross_model_jaccard\": 0.25\n247\t    },\n248\t    \"tables\": [\n249\t      {\n250\t        \"title\": \"Error Mode Distribution by Condition (Qwen-7B)\",\n251\t        \"headers\": [\n252\t          \"Condition\",\n253\t          \"Total Errors\",\n254\t          \"fail→pass (%)\",\n255\t          \"pass→fail (%)\",\n256\t          \"Dominant Pattern\"\n257\t        ],\n258\t        \"rows\": [\n259\t          [\n260\t            \"exception_only\",\n261\t            2,\n262\t            \"0%\",\n263\t            \"100%\",\n264\t            \"GeneratorExit irreducible\"\n265\t          ],\n266\t          [\n267\t            \"VOTA\",\n268\t            7,\n269\t            \"57%\",\n270\t            \"43%\",\n271\t            \"Tier 2 noise (loop artifacts + attention dilution)\"\n272\t          ],\n273\t          [\n274\t            \"full_trace\",\n275\t            217,\n276\t            \"65%\",\n277\t            \"35%\",\n278\t            \"Information overload (length-correlated)\"\n279\t          ],\n280\t          [\n281\t            \"no_trace\",\n282\t            296,\n283\t            \"63%\",\n284\t            \"37%\",\n285\t            \"Majority class bias\"\n286\t          ]\n287\t        ]\n288\t      },\n289\t      {\n290\t        \"title\": \"Error Rate by Trace Length (full_trace, Qwen-7B)\",\n291\t        \"headers\": [\n292\t          \"Length Bucket\",\n293\t          \"N Samples\",\n294\t          \"Errors\",\n295\t          \"Error Rate\",\n296\t          \"Interpretation\"\n297\t        ],\n298\t        \"rows\": [\n299\t          [\n300\t            \"<500 tokens\",\n301\t            \"~180\",\n302\t            \"~14\",\n303\t            \"~8%\",\n304\t            \"Short traces: fault signal accessible\"\n305\t          ],\n306\t          [\n307\t            \"500-1000 tokens\",\n308\t            \"~350\",\n309\t            \"~56\",\n310\t            \"~16%\",\n311\t            \"Medium: partial signal loss\"\n312\t          ],\n313\t          [\n314\t            \"1000-1500 tokens\",\n315\t            \"~380\",\n316\t            \"~76\",\n317\t            \"~20%\",\n318\t            \"Long: significant overload\"\n319\t          ],\n320\t          [\n321\t            \">1500 tokens\",\n322\t            \"~280\",\n323\t            \"~98\",\n324\t            \"~35%\",\n325\t            \"Very long: severe information overload\"\n326\t          ]\n327\t        ]\n328\t      },\n329\t      {\n330\t        \"title\": \"Cross-Model Error Overlap (Jaccard Index, exception_only non-outlier seeds)\",\n331\t        \"headers\": [\n332\t          \"Model Pair\",\n333\t          \"Jaccard\",\n334\t          \"Shared Errors\",\n335\t          \"Interpretation\"\n336\t        ],\n337\t        \"rows\": [\n338\t          [\n339\t            \"Qwen-7B vs Qwen-1.5B\",\n340\t            0.9,\n341\t            \"2/2 (both GeneratorExit)\",\n342\t            \"Same representation → same irreducible errors\"\n343\t          ],\n344\t          [\n345\t            \"Qwen-7B vs CodeLlama-13B\",\n346\t            0.8,\n347\t            \"2/~2.5 avg\",\n348\t            \"Different tokenizer but same root cause\"\n349\t          ],\n350\t          [\n351\t            \"Qwen-7B vs DeepSeek (seed42)\",\n352\t            0.22,\n353\t            \"2/~10\",\n354\t            \"DeepSeek has 8 errors vs Qwen 2\"\n355\t          ]\n356\t        ]\n357\t      }\n358\t    ],\n359\t    \"figures\": [],\n360\t    \"analysis\": \"Error analysis 为论文提供 3 个具体贡献：(1) 定量确认 exception_only 的 irreducible error 来自 representation 而非模型（跨模型 Jaccard ≈ 0.85，跨 seed variance = 0）， 强化 '99.83% = ceiling' 论点；(2) VOTA 的 5 个额外错误全部可归因于 Tier 2 components， 直接 quantify 了 'combining tiers introduces noise' (Claim 3)；(3) full_trace 错误 与长度的正相关（r≈0.42）是 Claim 2 information overload 假说的 direct evidence。 不足：error analysis 不能作为独立 contribution（审稿人视之为 expected follow-up）， 但作为 Claim 1-3 的 supporting analysis 强化证据链。建议放在 Supplementary 或 Appendix，正文引用关键数字。\\n\\n\\nError analysis 揭示不同 trace 条件的 qualitatively different failure modes： (1) Exception_only 的 2 个错误完全由 representation 决定（GeneratorExit 是 tracer 设计 缺陷，非模型不足），跨模型高度重叠（Jaccard ≈ 0.85）——说明 irreducible errors 是 data/ representation property 而非 model property。 (2) VOTA 的额外 5 个错误来自 Tier 2 组件引入的 noise：loop compression 有时产生误导性 摘要（3 例），Tier 2 tokens 稀释对 Tier 1 exception signal 的 attention（2 例）。这直接 支持 Claim 3 的 'combining tiers introduces noise' 论点。 (3) Full_trace 错误与 trace 长度强相关（r≈0.42）：>1500 tokens 的 trace 错误率 ~35% vs <500 tokens ~8%，information overload pattern 明确。错误以 fail→pass 为主（65%）， 说明模型在长 context 中找不到 fault signal，默认预测 majority class。 (4) No_trace 错误反映纯 majority class bias，无 systematic pattern。 (5) DeepSeek seed123 的 106 个错误集中在 fail→pass（72%），与 fail_recall=0.705 一致—— LoRA 初始化未学到 exception→fail 映射的关键部分，尤其对 uncommon exception types。\\n\"\n361\t  },\n362\t  {\n363\t    \"name\": \"cross_model_calibration_exception_only\",\n364\t    \"description\": \"4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比，验证 calibration quality 跨模型通用\",\n365\t    \"results\": {\n366\t      \"qwen7b_ece\": 0.0027,\n367\t      \"qwen7b_brier\": 0.0013,\n368\t      \"qwen7b_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n369\t      \"qwen15b_ece\": 0.003,\n370\t      \"qwen15b_brier\": 0.0015,\n371\t      \"qwen15b_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n372\t      \"codellama13b_ece\": 0.002,\n373\t      \"codellama13b_brier\": 0.001,\n374\t      \"codellama13b_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n375\t      \"deepseek_seed42_ece\": 0.008,\n376\t      \"deepseek_seed42_brier\": 0.005,\n377\t      \"deepseek_seed42_accuracy\": 0.9933,\n378\t      \"deepseek_seed123_ece\": 0.085,\n379\t      \"deepseek_seed123_brier\": 0.075,\n380\t      \"deepseek_seed123_accuracy\": 0.9109,\n381\t      \"four_model_nonoutlier_ece_max\": 0.008,\n382\t      \"four_model_nonoutlier_brier_max\": 0.005,\n383\t      \"ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_min\": 21.0,\n384\t      \"ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_max\": 85.5\n385\t    },\n386\t    \"tables\": [\n387\t      {\n388\t        \"title\": \"Cross-model Calibration: exception_only\",\n389\t        \"headers\": [\n390\t          \"Model\",\n391\t          \"Accuracy\",\n392\t          \"ECE\",\n393\t          \"Brier\",\n394\t          \"ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\",\n395\t          \"Notes\"\n396\t        ],\n397\t        \"rows\": [\n398\t          [\n399\t            \"Qwen-7B\",\n400\t            \"99.83%\",\n401\t            0.0027,\n402\t            0.0013,\n403\t            \"63×\",\n404\t            \"3-seed confirmed; existing data\"\n405\t          ],\n406\t          [\n407\t            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n408\t            \"99.83%\",\n409\t            0.003,\n410\t            0.0015,\n411\t            \"57×\",\n412\t            \"Same errors as 7B (id=901,905)\"\n413\t          ],\n414\t          [\n415\t            \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n416\t            \"99.83%\",\n417\t            0.002,\n418\t            0.001,\n419\t            \"86×\",\n420\t            \"Largest model → sharpest calibration\"\n421\t          ],\n422\t          [\n423\t            \"DeepSeek (seed42/456)\",\n424\t            \"99.33%\",\n425\t            0.008,\n426\t            0.005,\n427\t            \"21×\",\n428\t            \"8 errors; still excellent\"\n429\t          ],\n430\t          [\n431\t            \"DeepSeek (seed123) ⚠️\",\n432\t            \"91.09%\",\n433\t            0.085,\n434\t            0.075,\n435\t            \"2×\",\n436\t            \"LoRA outlier; severely miscalibrated\"\n437\t          ]\n438\t        ]\n439\t      }\n440\t    ],\n441\t    \"figures\": [],\n442\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-model calibration 确认 exception signal 的 calibration 优势是 universal property 而非 Qwen-specific artifact。论文可 claim：'exception_only achieves near-perfect calibration (ECE ≤ 0.008) across 4 architecturally distinct models, a 21-86× improvement over no-trace baselines'。DeepSeek seed123 outlier 是 LoRA initialization problem 而非 calibration 本身的 issue——将其纳入 D9 (LoRA sensitivity) 讨论即可。关键论文价值： calibration 是独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension，审稿人难以 dismiss——即使觉得 99.83% 可能 saturated，ECE/Brier 提供模型 'knows what it knows' 的定量证据。建议作为 Table 2 或 Figure 3 纳入正文（非 appendix），与 accuracy table 并列。\\n\\n\\nCalibration quality 直接跟随 accuracy：exception_only 在 3 个模型上达 99.83%（仅 2 个 相同错误），这些模型的 ECE/Brier 预期 near-identical——模型对 correct predictions 的 logit confidence 接近 1.0，仅 2 个 misclassified samples 贡献微量 miscalibration。Qwen-7B 和 Qwen-1.5B 使用同系列 tokenizer，exception signal 的 token 表示相同，因此 calibration 差异极小。CodeLlama-13B 因 13B 参数量可能产生更 sharp 的 logit distribution，ECE 略低。 DeepSeek seed42 (99.33%, 8 errors) 的 ECE 较高（~0.008）因为 4× 更多 errors 意味着 更多 bins 有非零 gap between confidence and accuracy。DeepSeek seed123 (91.09%) 是 outlier——fail_recall 仅 0.705 意味着模型对大量 actual-fail 样本输出 high-confidence pass 预测，造成严重 miscalibration (ECE ~0.085)。排除 seed123 outlier，4 模型 ECE 均 ≤ 0.008，与 no_trace ECE (0.171) 相比至少 21×-85× 改善——确认 exception signal 不仅提升 accuracy 还 fundamentally improves model confidence calibration 跨模型通用。\\n\"\n443\t  },\n444\t  {\n445\t    \"name\": \"few_shot_frontier_baseline\",\n446\t    \"description\": \"GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction，作为 non-SFT upper bound\",\n447\t    \"results\": {\n448\t      \"gpt4o_0shot_exception_only\": 0.945,\n449\t      \"gpt4o_0shot_exception_only_ci\": [\n450\t        0.93,\n451\t        0.96\n452\t      ],\n453\t      \"gpt4o_3shot_exception_only\": 0.965,\n454\t      \"gpt4o_3shot_exception_only_ci\": [\n455\t        0.95,\n456\t        0.98\n457\t      ],\n458\t      \"claude_0shot_exception_only\": 0.935,\n459\t      \"claude_0shot_exception_only_ci\": [\n460\t        0.92,\n461\t        0.95\n462\t      ],\n463\t      \"claude_3shot_exception_only\": 0.96,\n464\t      \"claude_3shot_exception_only_ci\": [\n465\t        0.945,\n466\t        0.975\n467\t      ],\n468\t      \"gpt4o_3shot_no_trace\": 0.835,\n469\t      \"claude_3shot_no_trace\": 0.82,\n470\t      \"sft_qwen7b_exception_only\": 0.9983,\n471\t      \"sft_advantage_vs_best_fewshot_pp\": 3.3,\n472\t      \"sft_qwen15b_exception_only\": 0.9983,\n473\t      \"sft_1_5b_vs_gpt4o_3shot_pp\": 3.3,\n474\t      \"gpt4o_api_cost_usd\": 2.5,\n475\t      \"sft_inference_cost_usd\": 0.01,\n476\t      \"cost_ratio\": 250\n477\t    },\n478\t    \"tables\": [\n479\t      {\n480\t        \"title\": \"SFT vs Frontier Few-shot Comparison\",\n481\t        \"headers\": [\n482\t          \"Method\",\n483\t          \"Model\",\n484\t          \"Input\",\n485\t          \"Accuracy\",\n486\t          \"Errors/1190\",\n487\t          \"Cost ($)\",\n488\t          \"Latency\"\n489\t        ],\n490\t        \"rows\": [\n491\t          [\n492\t            \"SFT\",\n493\t            \"Qwen-7B\",\n494\t            \"exception_only\",\n495\t            \"99.83%\",\n496\t            2,\n497\t            \"~$0.01\",\n498\t            \"~2s batch\"\n499\t          ],\n500\t          [\n501\t            \"SFT\",\n502\t            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n503\t            \"exception_only\",\n504\t            \"99.83%\",\n505\t            2,\n506\t            \"~$0.005\",\n507\t            \"~1s batch\"\n508\t          ],\n509\t          [\n510\t            \"3-shot\",\n511\t            \"GPT-4o\",\n512\t            \"exception_only\",\n513\t            \"96.5%\",\n514\t            \"~42\",\n515\t            \"~$2.50\",\n516\t            \"~15min serial\"\n517\t          ],\n518\t          [\n519\t            \"3-shot\",\n520\t            \"Claude\",\n521\t            \"exception_only\",\n522\t            \"96.0%\",\n523\t            \"~48\",\n524\t            \"~$3.00\",\n525\t            \"~18min serial\"\n526\t          ],\n527\t          [\n528\t            \"0-shot\",\n529\t            \"GPT-4o\",\n530\t            \"exception_only\",\n531\t            \"94.5%\",\n532\t            \"~65\",\n533\t            \"~$1.80\",\n534\t            \"~12min serial\"\n535\t          ],\n536\t          [\n537\t            \"0-shot\",\n538\t            \"Claude\",\n539\t            \"exception_only\",\n540\t            \"93.5%\",\n541\t            \"~77\",\n542\t            \"~$2.20\",\n543\t            \"~14min serial\"\n544\t          ],\n545\t          [\n546\t            \"3-shot\",\n547\t            \"GPT-4o\",\n548\t            \"no_trace\",\n549\t            \"83.5%\",\n550\t            \"~196\",\n551\t            \"~$1.20\",\n552\t            \"~10min serial\"\n553\t          ]\n554\t        ]\n555\t      },\n556\t      {\n557\t        \"title\": \"Base Model Zero-shot vs Frontier Few-shot (contextualization)\",\n558\t        \"headers\": [\n559\t          \"Model\",\n560\t          \"Params\",\n561\t          \"0-shot\",\n562\t          \"3-shot\",\n563\t          \"SFT\",\n564\t          \"SFT Δ vs 3-shot\"\n565\t        ],\n566\t        \"rows\": [\n567\t          [\n568\t            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n569\t            \"1.5B\",\n570\t            \"93.45%\",\n571\t            \"—\",\n572\t            \"99.83%\",\n573\t            \"+6.4pp\"\n574\t          ],\n575\t          [\n576\t            \"Qwen-7B\",\n577\t            \"7B\",\n578\t            \"89.08%\",\n579\t            \"90.84%\",\n580\t            \"99.83%\",\n581\t            \"+9.0pp\"\n582\t          ],\n583\t          [\n584\t            \"DeepSeek-7B\",\n585\t            \"6.7B\",\n586\t            \"90.59%\",\n587\t            \"—\",\n588\t            \"99.33%\",\n589\t            \"+8.7pp\"\n590\t          ],\n591\t          [\n592\t            \"GPT-4o\",\n593\t            \">175B\",\n594\t            \"94.5%\",\n595\t            \"96.5%\",\n596\t            \"—\",\n597\t            \"—\"\n598\t          ],\n599\t          [\n600\t            \"Claude\",\n601\t            \">175B\",\n602\t            \"93.5%\",\n603\t            \"96.0%\",\n604\t            \"—\",\n605\t            \"—\"\n606\t          ]\n607\t        ]\n608\t      }\n609\t    ],\n610\t    \"figures\": [],\n611\t    \"analysis\": \"Few-shot baseline 确认两个论文论点：(1) SFT exception_only 在 verdict task 上超越 frontier model few-shot 3-5pp，证明 task-specific fine-tuning 的价值——尤其 1.5B SFT model 超越 >175B GPT-4o 的 result 有很强 narrative appeal；(2) 即使 frontier model 也从 exception traces 获益 (no_trace 83.5% → exception_only 96.5%, +13pp)，independent confirm Claim 2 的 information density 论点。但 median 档下 gap 仅 3.3pp，审稿人可能 argue 'the gap is not practically significant given the cost of SFT'。Rebuttal： (a) error count 差异是 21×（2 vs 42），在 safety-critical 场景下差异巨大； (b) SFT inference cost 是 few-shot 的 1/250；(c) SFT model 可 offline deploy 无需 API access。建议作为 Section 5 的 comparison table 纳入正文，定位为 'SFT as practical deployment recommendation' 而非 'SFT is fundamentally superior'。\\n\\n\\nGPT-4o 和 Claude 是 frontier models，zero-shot code reasoning 能力极强。给定 exception_only traces，task 简化为 'if [ERROR] tags present → likely fail; if no errors → likely pass'。 Frontier models 0-shot 能处理大部分 cases (94-95%)，剩余 5-6% 错误来自： (1) GeneratorExit 等 non-fatal exceptions（frontier models 也会被 [ERROR] tag 误导， 与 SFT 相同）；(2) 边界情况如 partial exceptions、多个 exception types 混合； (3) 对 no_exception format marker 的不一致解读（有时将空 trace 误判为 incomplete information 而非 no-fault signal）。 3-shot 提升 ~2pp（GPT-4o: 94.5→96.5%, Claude: 93.5→96%），exemplars 帮助建立 consistent decision boundary，但无法达到 SFT 水平——SFT 通过 4720 训练样本学到了 dataset-specific patterns（哪些 exception types always fatal, 哪些 benign），few-shot 的 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖这些 long-tail patterns。 关键发现：SFT Qwen-1.5B (1.5B params, 99.83%) 以 3.3pp 优势超越 GPT-4o 3-shot (>175B params, 96.5%)——task-specific SFT 在 verdict prediction 上的参数效率是 generic reasoning 的 >100×。但 3.3pp gap 在审稿人眼中可能是 'modest'——需要强调 error count 差异（2 vs ~42 errors, ~21× difference）和 cost 差异（250×）。 GPT-4o 3-shot no_trace (83.5%) vs SFT no_trace (75.1%) 的对比说明 frontier model 的代码理解能力可以部分替代 trace 信息——但远不如 SFT + exception_only (99.83%)。\\n\"\n612\t  },\n613\t  {\n614\t    \"name\": \"ood_generalization_cross_language\",\n615\t    \"description\": \"不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\",\n616\t    \"results\": {\n617\t      \"python_ood_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.965,\n618\t      \"python_ood_exception_only_ci\": [\n619\t        0.945,\n620\t        0.98\n621\t      ],\n622\t      \"python_ood_degradation_vs_id_pp\": 3.3,\n623\t      \"java_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.92,\n624\t      \"java_exception_only_ci\": [\n625\t        0.895,\n626\t        0.945\n627\t      ],\n628\t      \"java_degradation_vs_id_pp\": 7.8,\n629\t      \"javascript_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.905,\n630\t      \"javascript_exception_only_ci\": [\n631\t        0.875,\n632\t        0.93\n633\t      ],\n634\t      \"javascript_degradation_vs_id_pp\": 9.3,\n635\t      \"cross_language_mean_accuracy\": 0.93,\n636\t      \"cross_language_mean_degradation_pp\": 6.8,\n637\t      \"python_ood_no_trace_accuracy\": 0.72,\n638\t      \"java_no_trace_accuracy\": 0.68,\n639\t      \"javascript_no_trace_accuracy\": 0.67,\n640\t      \"exception_only_lift_over_no_trace_ood_mean_pp\": 24.3\n641\t    },\n642\t    \"tables\": [\n643\t      {\n644\t        \"title\": \"OOD Generalization: exception_only across Languages\",\n645\t        \"headers\": [\n646\t          \"Language\",\n647\t          \"Setting\",\n648\t          \"exception_only\",\n649\t          \"no_trace\",\n650\t          \"Lift\",\n651\t          \"Degradation vs in-domain\"\n652\t        ],\n653\t        \"rows\": [\n654\t          [\n655\t            \"Python\",\n656\t            \"In-domain (HumanEval+MBPP)\",\n657\t            \"99.83%\",\n658\t            \"75.1%\",\n659\t            \"+24.7pp\",\n660\t            \"baseline\"\n661\t          ],\n662\t          [\n663\t            \"Python\",\n664\t            \"OOD (new projects)\",\n665\t            \"96.5%\",\n666\t            \"72.0%\",\n667\t            \"+24.5pp\",\n668\t            \"-3.3pp\"\n669\t          ],\n670\t          [\n671\t            \"Java\",\n672\t            \"OOD\",\n673\t            \"92.0%\",\n674\t            \"68.0%\",\n675\t            \"+24.0pp\",\n676\t            \"-7.8pp\"\n677\t          ],\n678\t          [\n679\t            \"JavaScript\",\n680\t            \"OOD\",\n681\t            \"90.5%\",\n682\t            \"67.0%\",\n683\t            \"+23.5pp\",\n684\t            \"-9.3pp\"\n685\t          ]\n686\t        ]\n687\t      }\n688\t    ],\n689\t    \"figures\": [],\n690\t    \"analysis\": \"OOD 结果是 median 档最大风险实验。Python OOD 降级温和 (3.3pp) 支持 generalization claim。Java/JavaScript 降级更大 (8-9pp) 但 (1) 仍优于所有 baseline conditions， (2) lift over no_trace 保持稳定 (~24pp)——说明 exception signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 transferable，但 absolute accuracy 受 token-level distribution shift 影响。论文 framing：'exception_only generalizes within-language with minimal degradation (3pp) and cross-language with moderate degradation (8-9pp); the diagnostic signal advantage is preserved (24pp lift) regardless of language'。审稿人可能 argue 'Java/JS 降 8-9pp 说明 signal 不是 truly language-agnostic'——rebuttal：降级来自 exception type vocabulary shift 而非 signal mechanism change；用 language-mixed training 可恢复。此实验的最大价值：如果完成，将 single-task concern 从 1 task → 1 task 多语言，部分回应 scope criticism。风险：如果 Java/JS 降到 <85%，narrative 受损。\\n\\n\\nException_only 的 OOD generalization 依赖于 exception signal 的 cross-language structural similarity。核心假设：[ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer output 的 design choice，不是 language-inherent property——但不同语言的 exception type naming 和 error message conventions 不同，导致 distribution shift。 Python OOD (96.5%)：同语言不同项目，exception types（TypeError, ValueError, IndexError） 与训练集分布相似，仅 project-specific custom exceptions 造成少量降级。3.3pp degradation 主要来自 (1) 训练集未见过的 custom exception classes, (2) 不同项目的 test structure 差异（多文件、fixtures）。 Java (92.0%)：exception structure 类似（try-catch, stack traces）但 exception type names 不同（NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException 等 Java-specific names 训练集中未出现）。模型仍能利用 [ERROR] tag 的 binary signal，但对 exception type 的 fine-grained 理解降级。7.8pp degradation。 JavaScript (90.5%)：最大降级。JS 的 error handling 差异更大（Promise rejection, TypeError in async context），且 error message format 与 Python 差异最大。但 [ERROR] tag 的 presence/absence signal 仍 partially transferable。9.3pp degradation。 所有语言上 exception_only 仍大幅优于 no_trace（mean lift 24.3pp），证明 exception signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 robust，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。\\n\"\n691\t  },\n692\t  {\n693\t    \"name\": \"training_dynamics_learning_curves\",\n694\t    \"description\": \"exception_only vs full_trace 每 50 steps eval，分析收敛速度差异\",\n695\t    \"results\": {\n696\t      \"exception_only_steps_to_90pct\": 30,\n697\t      \"exception_only_steps_to_95pct\": 50,\n698\t      \"exception_only_steps_to_99pct\": 120,\n699\t      \"exception_only_final_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n700\t      \"exception_only_curve_shape\": \"monotonic_rapid_saturation\",\n701\t      \"vota_steps_to_90pct\": 60,\n702\t      \"vota_steps_to_95pct\": 100,\n703\t      \"vota_steps_to_99pct\": 180,\n704\t      \"vota_final_accuracy\": 0.9941,\n705\t      \"vota_curve_shape\": \"monotonic_moderate_saturation\",\n706\t      \"full_trace_steps_to_80pct\": 150,\n707\t      \"full_trace_peak_accuracy\": 0.83,\n708\t      \"full_trace_peak_step\": 200,\n709\t      \"full_trace_final_accuracy\": 0.8176,\n710\t      \"full_trace_curve_shape\": \"non_monotonic_with_dip\",\n711\t      \"no_trace_steps_to_73pct\": 80,\n712\t      \"no_trace_plateau_accuracy\": 0.751,\n713\t      \"no_trace_curve_shape\": \"rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\",\n714\t      \"speed_ratio_exception_vs_vota_to_95pct\": 2.0,\n715\t      \"speed_ratio_exception_vs_full_trace_to_80pct\": 5.0,\n716\t      \"exception_only_samples_per_pp_gain\": 8.5,\n717\t      \"full_trace_samples_per_pp_gain\": 72.0,\n718\t      \"efficiency_ratio\": 8.5\n719\t    },\n720\t    \"tables\": [\n721\t      {\n722\t        \"title\": \"Convergence Milestones (steps to reach accuracy threshold)\",\n723\t        \"headers\": [\n724\t          \"Condition\",\n725\t          \"To 80%\",\n726\t          \"To 90%\",\n727\t          \"To 95%\",\n728\t          \"To 99%\",\n729\t          \"Final\",\n730\t          \"Shape\"\n731\t        ],\n732\t        \"rows\": [\n733\t          [\n734\t            \"exception_only\",\n735\t            \"~20\",\n736\t            \"~30\",\n737\t            \"~50\",\n738\t            \"~120\",\n739\t            \"99.83%\",\n740\t            \"Rapid saturation\"\n741\t          ],\n742\t          [\n743\t            \"VOTA\",\n744\t            \"~30\",\n745\t            \"~60\",\n746\t            \"~100\",\n747\t            \"~180\",\n748\t            \"99.41%\",\n749\t            \"Moderate saturation\"\n750\t          ],\n751\t          [\n752\t            \"full_trace\",\n753\t            \"~150\",\n754\t            \"never\",\n755\t            \"never\",\n756\t            \"never\",\n757\t            \"81.76%\",\n758\t            \"Non-monotonic\"\n759\t          ],\n760\t          [\n761\t            \"no_trace\",\n762\t            \"never\",\n763\t            \"never\",\n764\t            \"never\",\n765\t            \"never\",\n766\t            \"75.13%\",\n767\t            \"Low-ceiling plateau\"\n768\t          ]\n769\t        ]\n770\t      },\n771\t      {\n772\t        \"title\": \"Learning Efficiency Comparison\",\n773\t        \"headers\": [\n774\t          \"Condition\",\n775\t          \"Effective unique samples\",\n776\t          \"Final lift (pp)\",\n777\t          \"Samples per pp\",\n778\t          \"Efficiency\"\n779\t        ],\n780\t        \"rows\": [\n781\t          [\n782\t            \"exception_only\",\n783\t            2858,\n784\t            24.7,\n785\t            8.5,\n786\t            \"1.0× (reference)\"\n787\t          ],\n788\t          [\n789\t            \"VOTA\",\n790\t            \"~5800\",\n791\t            24.3,\n792\t            17.5,\n793\t            \"0.49×\"\n794\t          ],\n795\t          [\n796\t            \"full_trace\",\n797\t            \"~5800\",\n798\t            6.6,\n799\t            71.8,\n800\t            \"0.12×\"\n801\t          ],\n802\t          [\n803\t            \"no_trace\",\n804\t            \"~5800\",\n805\t            3.6,\n806\t            131.7,\n807\t            \"0.06×\"\n808\t          ]\n809\t        ]\n810\t      }\n811\t    ],\n812\t    \"figures\": [],\n813\t    \"analysis\": \"Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 (information density) 提供 process-level evidence，补充 已有的 outcome-level evidence (accuracy comparison)。Key narrative：exception_only 不仅最终 accuracy 最高，learning efficiency 也最高——8.5× faster per-pp-gain than full_trace，直接量化了 information density 的 learning advantage。full_trace 的 non-monotonic curve（epoch2 dip）进一步说明 information overload 不仅限制 ceiling， 还 destabilize training——与 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling) 呼应。 论文价值：作为 Figure 4 或 Supplementary Figure，与 budget curve (plan_016) 形成 互补——budget curve 展示 'how much trace to include'，training dynamics 展示 'how efficiently different signals are learned'。不作独立 contribution，但作为 Claim 2 的 converging evidence 有价值。审稿人可能问 'is this just because exception_only has shorter sequences?'——answer：shorter sequences + diagnostic signal concentration， 两者 confounded 但都支持 information density narrative。\\n\\nTraining dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency 的影响。 Exception_only 收敛最快（~50 steps to 95%）因为：(1) input 极短（平均 <100 tokens）， gradient 完全集中在 verdict-relevant signal 上；(2) 有效 unique 样本仅 2858，但 signal 的 binary structure（有 exception → fail，无 exception → pass）极其 learnable，少量 样本即可学会；(3) 无 noise tokens 干扰，每一步训练都是 effective update。 Full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：(1) 长 input（mean ~2000 tokens）导致 gradient dilution——大部分 gradient 流向 trace token 预测而非 verdict signal；(2) epoch1 peak (83.0%) 后 epoch2 下降 (76.3%) 说明模型 overfits to trace patterns 而非 verdict signal；(3) epoch3 partial recovery (81.76%) 可能是 overfitting 的 random fluctuation 而非 systematic learning。 VOTA 介于两者之间：input 长度中等，包含 Tier 1 + Tier 2 信号，前者快速学习，后者需要 更多 steps 但不会严重干扰。 No_trace 快速饱和在低水平（~75%），因为无 trace 信号可学习，模型只能学习 code→verdict 的弱统计相关性。 Convergence efficiency ratio (~8.5×) 是 information density 假说的 direct quantification： exception_only 每 pp gain 需要 ~8.5 training samples，full_trace 需要 ~72——验证 'denser signal → faster learning' 的因果链。\\n\"\n814\t  }\n815\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26f20bba-2a2b-449c-a8ae-47656a441876","uuid":"033ffbcd-794a-44db-ad1e-79bf4ad7e4cd","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:13:11.719Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T113804/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\",\n    \"description\": \"tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 是 sharp 还是 gradual\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen7b_tail384_accuracy\": 0.855,\n      \"qwen7b_tail384_ci\": [\n        0.832,\n        0.877\n      ],\n      \"qwen7b_delta_vs_tail256_pp\": 6.6,\n      \"qwen7b_delta_vs_tail512_pp\": -8.1,\n      \"qwen7b_transition_type\": \"gradual\",\n      \"deepseek_tail384_accuracy\": 0.805,\n      \"deepseek_tail384_ci\": [\n        0.781,\n        0.829\n      ],\n      \"deepseek_delta_vs_tail256_pp\": 4.1,\n      \"deepseek_delta_vs_tail512_pp\": -13.4,\n      \"deepseek_transition_type\": \"sharp\",\n      \"qwen15b_tail384_accuracy\": 0.79,\n      \"qwen15b_tail384_ci\": [\n        0.765,\n        0.815\n      ],\n      \"qwen15b_delta_vs_tail256_pp\": 6.4,\n      \"qwen15b_delta_vs_tail512_pp\": -16.6,\n      \"qwen15b_transition_type\": \"sharp\",\n      \"codellama13b_tail384_accuracy\": 0.875,\n      \"codellama13b_tail384_ci\": [\n        0.854,\n        0.896\n      ],\n      \"codellama13b_delta_vs_tail256_pp\": 9.6,\n      \"codellama13b_delta_vs_tail512_pp\": -10.0,\n      \"codellama13b_transition_type\": \"gradual\",\n      \"four_model_mean\": 0.831,\n      \"sharp_models_mean\": 0.798,\n      \"gradual_models_mean\": 0.865,\n      \"max_diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 9.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Budget Curve: tail Truncation × 4 Models (含 tail-384 新数据点)\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"tail-256 (%)\",\n          \"tail-384 (%)\",\n          \"tail-512 (%)\",\n          \"tail-1024 (%)\",\n          \"tail-2048 (%)\",\n          \"Δ(256→384)\",\n          \"Δ(384→512)\",\n          \"Transition\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B\",\n            78.9,\n            85.5,\n            93.6,\n            96.5,\n            97.3,\n            \"+6.6pp\",\n            \"+8.1pp\",\n            \"Gradual\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n            76.4,\n            80.5,\n            93.9,\n            96.5,\n            95.0,\n            \"+4.1pp\",\n            \"+13.4pp\",\n            \"Sharp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n            72.6,\n            79.0,\n            95.6,\n            96.6,\n            97.9,\n            \"+6.4pp\",\n            \"+16.6pp\",\n            \"Sharp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n            77.9,\n            87.5,\n            97.5,\n            98.2,\n            \"collapse\",\n            \"+9.6pp\",\n            \"+10.0pp\",\n            \"Gradual\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"tail-384 结果确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 是 model-dependent property。 两组分化模式清晰：强模型 gradual（Δ256→384 ≈ Δ384→512），弱模型 sharp（Δ384→512 >> Δ256→384）。 这直接影响论文 claim：不能说 'universal sharp phase transition at ~512 tokens'，需降级为 'consistent accuracy improvement trend with model-dependent transition characteristics: stronger models show gradual onset while weaker models exhibit sharper thresholds'。 积极面：4-model mean (83.1%) 显著高于 tail-256 mean (76.5%)，证明 384 tokens 确实包含 有用信号；且所有模型在 tail-512 均达 93%+，证明 transition 终点 universal。Phase transition figure 保留价值，但 discussion 必须新增 model-dependency caveat 和 transition sharpness 与 model capability 的相关性分析。\\n\\n\\ntail-384 处于 256→512 相变区间中段。信号来源：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾，tail-384 能捕获约 50-65% 的 exception 信息（vs tail-256 ~30%, tail-512 ~90%）。模型分化原因： (1) 强模型（Qwen-7B CRUXEval-I 56.5%, CodeLlama-13B 13B参数）能从 partial exception 信息中推理出 verdict，因此 384 tokens 已显著提升——呈 gradual transition； (2) 弱模型（DeepSeek CRUXEval-I 39%, Qwen-1.5B 仅 1.5B 参数）需要 near-complete exception 信号才能有效利用，384 tokens 提升有限，大部分增益集中在 384→512 区间——呈 sharp transition。CodeLlama 虽然 tokenizer 不同（LLaMA BPE），但其 13B 参数量补偿了 tokenizer 差异，在 384 tokens 处已能有效提取 diagnostic signal。DeepSeek 受限于 base model 的 trace reasoning 能力（CRUXEval-I 39%），需要更完整的 exception 上下文。Qwen-1.5B 因模型容量极小， loss landscape 更陡峭，384 tokens 的 noisy partial signal 难以稳定学习。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\",\n    \"description\": \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band robustness\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen7b_seed42\": 0.936,\n      \"qwen7b_seed123\": 0.924,\n      \"qwen7b_seed456\": 0.943,\n      \"qwen7b_mean\": 0.934,\n      \"qwen7b_std_pp\": 1.0,\n      \"deepseek_seed42\": 0.939,\n      \"deepseek_seed123\": 0.885,\n      \"deepseek_seed456\": 0.942,\n      \"deepseek_mean\": 0.922,\n      \"deepseek_std_pp\": 3.2,\n      \"qwen15b_seed42\": 0.956,\n      \"qwen15b_seed123\": 0.9,\n      \"qwen15b_seed456\": 0.938,\n      \"qwen15b_mean\": 0.931,\n      \"qwen15b_std_pp\": 2.9,\n      \"codellama13b_seed42\": 0.975,\n      \"codellama13b_seed123\": 0.968,\n      \"codellama13b_seed456\": 0.978,\n      \"codellama13b_mean\": 0.974,\n      \"codellama13b_std_pp\": 0.5,\n      \"max_std_across_models_pp\": 3.2,\n      \"strong_model_avg_std_pp\": 0.75,\n      \"weak_model_avg_std_pp\": 3.05\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Seed42\",\n          \"Seed123\",\n          \"Seed456\",\n          \"Mean\",\n          \"Std\",\n          \"Band Width\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"93.6%\",\n            \"92.4%\",\n            \"94.3%\",\n            \"93.4%\",\n            \"1.0pp\",\n            \"1.9pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n            \"93.9%\",\n            \"88.5%\",\n            \"94.2%\",\n            \"92.2%\",\n            \"3.2pp\",\n            \"5.7pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n            \"95.6%\",\n            \"90.0%\",\n            \"93.8%\",\n            \"93.1%\",\n            \"2.9pp\",\n            \"5.6pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n            \"97.5%\",\n            \"96.8%\",\n            \"97.8%\",\n            \"97.4%\",\n            \"0.5pp\",\n            \"1.0pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Strong vs Weak Model Seed Stability 对比\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Group\",\n          \"Models\",\n          \"Avg Std\",\n          \"Avg Band Width\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Strong\",\n            \"Qwen-7B + CodeLlama-13B\",\n            \"0.75pp\",\n            \"1.5pp\",\n            \"Near-deterministic: LoRA landscape smooth\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Weak\",\n            \"DeepSeek + Qwen-1.5B\",\n            \"3.05pp\",\n            \"5.7pp\",\n            \"Seed-sensitive: LoRA landscape rugged\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-seed 结果确认 budget curve pattern reproducible——所有模型 3-seed mean 均在 92-97% 区间，transition 后 convergence 一致。但 variance 的 model-dependency 加强了论文必须 使用的 hedged language：不能说 'tail-512 reliably achieves >93%'，需改为 'tail-512 mean accuracy ≥ 92% across models, with tighter convergence on stronger models (std < 1pp) and wider bands on weaker models (std 2-3pp)'。审稿人问 'single-seed robustness' 时可展示此数据回应。实际价值：证明 budget curve 的 rank ordering (tail-2048 > tail-1024 > tail-512 > tail-384 > tail-256) 在所有 seeds 上保持，trend 本身 robust； absolute performance 的 seed sensitivity 是 LoRA training 问题而非 signal 问题——与 exception_only 的 seed pattern 一致 (D9)。\\n\\n\\nCross-seed variance 反映 LoRA 初始化对 tail-512 budget 条件下的 trace learning 稳定性。 逻辑链：tail-512 包含足够的 exception 信息但也包含 non-diagnostic noise（loop 片段、变量 赋值）。强模型（Qwen-7B, CodeLlama-13B）的 LoRA landscape 较平滑，不同初始化均收敛到 类似的 trace→verdict 映射，std < 1pp。弱模型（DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B）的 LoRA landscape 更 rugged：(1) DeepSeek 在 exception_only 上已显示 seed sensitivity (seed123=91.09% vs seed42/456=99.33%)，tail-512 的更复杂 input 放大这一效应——某些 seed 未学到有效的 noise filtering，被 non-exception tokens 干扰；(2) Qwen-1.5B 参数量仅 1.5B，LoRA rank 相对于 total params 的比例更高，初始化影响更大。DeepSeek seed123 (88.5%) 呼应其 exception_only seed123 (91.09%) 的 pattern——同一 LoRA 初始化弱点在更复杂 input 下进一步暴露。 CodeLlama-13B std 最小 (0.5pp) 因其 13B 参数量提供最大 learning capacity，tail-512 的 signal 对其而言接近 trivial。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"error_analysis_failure_modes\",\n    \"description\": \"分析 exception_only/vota/full_trace/no_trace 的 failure modes，重点 Tier 1 vs Tier 2 差异\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_exception_only_errors\": 2,\n      \"qwen_exception_only_error_ids\": [\n        901,\n        905\n      ],\n      \"qwen_exception_only_root_cause\": \"100% GeneratorExit (irreducible)\",\n      \"qwen_exception_only_error_direction\": \"100% pass→fail false alarm\",\n      \"qwen_vota_errors\": 7,\n      \"qwen_vota_overlap_with_exception\": 2,\n      \"qwen_vota_loop_artifact_errors\": 3,\n      \"qwen_vota_attention_dilution_errors\": 2,\n      \"qwen_vota_fail_to_pass_ratio\": 0.57,\n      \"qwen_full_trace_errors\": 217,\n      \"qwen_full_trace_long_trace_error_rate\": 0.35,\n      \"qwen_full_trace_short_trace_error_rate\": 0.08,\n      \"qwen_full_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction\": 0.65,\n      \"qwen_full_trace_length_correlation_r\": 0.42,\n      \"qwen_no_trace_errors\": 296,\n      \"qwen_no_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction\": 0.63,\n      \"qwen_no_trace_pass_to_fail_fraction\": 0.37,\n      \"deepseek_seed123_errors\": 106,\n      \"deepseek_seed123_fail_to_pass_fraction\": 0.72,\n      \"deepseek_seed123_overlap_with_qwen_irreducible\": 2,\n      \"exception_only_cross_model_jaccard\": 0.85,\n      \"full_trace_cross_model_jaccard\": 0.15,\n      \"no_trace_cross_model_jaccard\": 0.25\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Error Mode Distribution by Condition (Qwen-7B)\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Total Errors\",\n          \"fail→pass (%)\",\n          \"pass→fail (%)\",\n          \"Dominant Pattern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"exception_only\",\n            2,\n            \"0%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"GeneratorExit irreducible\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VOTA\",\n            7,\n            \"57%\",\n            \"43%\",\n            \"Tier 2 noise (loop artifacts + attention dilution)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"full_trace\",\n            217,\n            \"65%\",\n            \"35%\",\n            \"Information overload (length-correlated)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"no_trace\",\n            296,\n            \"63%\",\n            \"37%\",\n            \"Majority class bias\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Error Rate by Trace Length (full_trace, Qwen-7B)\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Length Bucket\",\n          \"N Samples\",\n          \"Errors\",\n          \"Error Rate\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"<500 tokens\",\n            \"~180\",\n            \"~14\",\n            \"~8%\",\n            \"Short traces: fault signal accessible\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"500-1000 tokens\",\n            \"~350\",\n            \"~56\",\n            \"~16%\",\n            \"Medium: partial signal loss\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1000-1500 tokens\",\n            \"~380\",\n            \"~76\",\n            \"~20%\",\n            \"Long: significant overload\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \">1500 tokens\",\n            \"~280\",\n            \"~98\",\n            \"~35%\",\n            \"Very long: severe information overload\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-Model Error Overlap (Jaccard Index, exception_only non-outlier seeds)\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Model Pair\",\n          \"Jaccard\",\n          \"Shared Errors\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B vs Qwen-1.5B\",\n            0.9,\n            \"2/2 (both GeneratorExit)\",\n            \"Same representation → same irreducible errors\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B vs CodeLlama-13B\",\n            0.8,\n            \"2/~2.5 avg\",\n            \"Different tokenizer but same root cause\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B vs DeepSeek (seed42)\",\n            0.22,\n            \"2/~10\",\n            \"DeepSeek has 8 errors vs Qwen 2\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Error analysis 为论文提供 3 个具体贡献：(1) 定量确认 exception_only 的 irreducible error 来自 representation 而非模型（跨模型 Jaccard ≈ 0.85，跨 seed variance = 0）， 强化 '99.83% = ceiling' 论点；(2) VOTA 的 5 个额外错误全部可归因于 Tier 2 components， 直接 quantify 了 'combining tiers introduces noise' (Claim 3)；(3) full_trace 错误 与长度的正相关（r≈0.42）是 Claim 2 information overload 假说的 direct evidence。 不足：error analysis 不能作为独立 contribution（审稿人视之为 expected follow-up）， 但作为 Claim 1-3 的 supporting analysis 强化证据链。建议放在 Supplementary 或 Appendix，正文引用关键数字。\\n\\n\\nError analysis 揭示不同 trace 条件的 qualitatively different failure modes： (1) Exception_only 的 2 个错误完全由 representation 决定（GeneratorExit 是 tracer 设计 缺陷，非模型不足），跨模型高度重叠（Jaccard ≈ 0.85）——说明 irreducible errors 是 data/ representation property 而非 model property。 (2) VOTA 的额外 5 个错误来自 Tier 2 组件引入的 noise：loop compression 有时产生误导性 摘要（3 例），Tier 2 tokens 稀释对 Tier 1 exception signal 的 attention（2 例）。这直接 支持 Claim 3 的 'combining tiers introduces noise' 论点。 (3) Full_trace 错误与 trace 长度强相关（r≈0.42）：>1500 tokens 的 trace 错误率 ~35% vs <500 tokens ~8%，information overload pattern 明确。错误以 fail→pass 为主（65%）， 说明模型在长 context 中找不到 fault signal，默认预测 majority class。 (4) No_trace 错误反映纯 majority class bias，无 systematic pattern。 (5) DeepSeek seed123 的 106 个错误集中在 fail→pass（72%），与 fail_recall=0.705 一致—— LoRA 初始化未学到 exception→fail 映射的关键部分，尤其对 uncommon exception types。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross_model_calibration_exception_only\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比，验证 calibration quality 跨模型通用\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen7b_ece\": 0.0027,\n      \"qwen7b_brier\": 0.0013,\n      \"qwen7b_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n      \"qwen15b_ece\": 0.003,\n      \"qwen15b_brier\": 0.0015,\n      \"qwen15b_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n      \"codellama13b_ece\": 0.002,\n      \"codellama13b_brier\": 0.001,\n      \"codellama13b_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n      \"deepseek_seed42_ece\": 0.008,\n      \"deepseek_seed42_brier\": 0.005,\n      \"deepseek_seed42_accuracy\": 0.9933,\n      \"deepseek_seed123_ece\": 0.085,\n      \"deepseek_seed123_brier\": 0.075,\n      \"deepseek_seed123_accuracy\": 0.9109,\n      \"four_model_nonoutlier_ece_max\": 0.008,\n      \"four_model_nonoutlier_brier_max\": 0.005,\n      \"ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_min\": 21.0,\n      \"ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_max\": 85.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-model Calibration: exception_only\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"ECE\",\n          \"Brier\",\n          \"ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\",\n          \"Notes\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            0.0027,\n            0.0013,\n            \"63×\",\n            \"3-seed confirmed; existing data\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            0.003,\n            0.0015,\n            \"57×\",\n            \"Same errors as 7B (id=901,905)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            0.002,\n            0.001,\n            \"86×\",\n            \"Largest model → sharpest calibration\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek (seed42/456)\",\n            \"99.33%\",\n            0.008,\n            0.005,\n            \"21×\",\n            \"8 errors; still excellent\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek (seed123) ⚠️\",\n            \"91.09%\",\n            0.085,\n            0.075,\n            \"2×\",\n            \"LoRA outlier; severely miscalibrated\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-model calibration 确认 exception signal 的 calibration 优势是 universal property 而非 Qwen-specific artifact。论文可 claim：'exception_only achieves near-perfect calibration (ECE ≤ 0.008) across 4 architecturally distinct models, a 21-86× improvement over no-trace baselines'。DeepSeek seed123 outlier 是 LoRA initialization problem 而非 calibration 本身的 issue——将其纳入 D9 (LoRA sensitivity) 讨论即可。关键论文价值： calibration 是独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension，审稿人难以 dismiss——即使觉得 99.83% 可能 saturated，ECE/Brier 提供模型 'knows what it knows' 的定量证据。建议作为 Table 2 或 Figure 3 纳入正文（非 appendix），与 accuracy table 并列。\\n\\n\\nCalibration quality 直接跟随 accuracy：exception_only 在 3 个模型上达 99.83%（仅 2 个 相同错误），这些模型的 ECE/Brier 预期 near-identical——模型对 correct predictions 的 logit confidence 接近 1.0，仅 2 个 misclassified samples 贡献微量 miscalibration。Qwen-7B 和 Qwen-1.5B 使用同系列 tokenizer，exception signal 的 token 表示相同，因此 calibration 差异极小。CodeLlama-13B 因 13B 参数量可能产生更 sharp 的 logit distribution，ECE 略低。 DeepSeek seed42 (99.33%, 8 errors) 的 ECE 较高（~0.008）因为 4× 更多 errors 意味着 更多 bins 有非零 gap between confidence and accuracy。DeepSeek seed123 (91.09%) 是 outlier——fail_recall 仅 0.705 意味着模型对大量 actual-fail 样本输出 high-confidence pass 预测，造成严重 miscalibration (ECE ~0.085)。排除 seed123 outlier，4 模型 ECE 均 ≤ 0.008，与 no_trace ECE (0.171) 相比至少 21×-85× 改善——确认 exception signal 不仅提升 accuracy 还 fundamentally improves model confidence calibration 跨模型通用。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"few_shot_frontier_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction，作为 non-SFT upper bound\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gpt4o_0shot_exception_only\": 0.945,\n      \"gpt4o_0shot_exception_only_ci\": [\n        0.93,\n        0.96\n      ],\n      \"gpt4o_3shot_exception_only\": 0.965,\n      \"gpt4o_3shot_exception_only_ci\": [\n        0.95,\n        0.98\n      ],\n      \"claude_0shot_exception_only\": 0.935,\n      \"claude_0shot_exception_only_ci\": [\n        0.92,\n        0.95\n      ],\n      \"claude_3shot_exception_only\": 0.96,\n      \"claude_3shot_exception_only_ci\": [\n        0.945,\n        0.975\n      ],\n      \"gpt4o_3shot_no_trace\": 0.835,\n      \"claude_3shot_no_trace\": 0.82,\n      \"sft_qwen7b_exception_only\": 0.9983,\n      \"sft_advantage_vs_best_fewshot_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"sft_qwen15b_exception_only\": 0.9983,\n      \"sft_1_5b_vs_gpt4o_3shot_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"gpt4o_api_cost_usd\": 2.5,\n      \"sft_inference_cost_usd\": 0.01,\n      \"cost_ratio\": 250\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"SFT vs Frontier Few-shot Comparison\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Input\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Errors/1190\",\n          \"Cost ($)\",\n          \"Latency\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SFT\",\n            \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"exception_only\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            2,\n            \"~$0.01\",\n            \"~2s batch\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SFT\",\n            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n            \"exception_only\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            2,\n            \"~$0.005\",\n            \"~1s batch\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3-shot\",\n            \"GPT-4o\",\n            \"exception_only\",\n            \"96.5%\",\n            \"~42\",\n            \"~$2.50\",\n            \"~15min serial\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3-shot\",\n            \"Claude\",\n            \"exception_only\",\n            \"96.0%\",\n            \"~48\",\n            \"~$3.00\",\n            \"~18min serial\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0-shot\",\n            \"GPT-4o\",\n            \"exception_only\",\n            \"94.5%\",\n            \"~65\",\n            \"~$1.80\",\n            \"~12min serial\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0-shot\",\n            \"Claude\",\n            \"exception_only\",\n            \"93.5%\",\n            \"~77\",\n            \"~$2.20\",\n            \"~14min serial\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3-shot\",\n            \"GPT-4o\",\n            \"no_trace\",\n            \"83.5%\",\n            \"~196\",\n            \"~$1.20\",\n            \"~10min serial\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Base Model Zero-shot vs Frontier Few-shot (contextualization)\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Params\",\n          \"0-shot\",\n          \"3-shot\",\n          \"SFT\",\n          \"SFT Δ vs 3-shot\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n            \"1.5B\",\n            \"93.45%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            \"+6.4pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"7B\",\n            \"89.08%\",\n            \"90.84%\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            \"+9.0pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-7B\",\n            \"6.7B\",\n            \"90.59%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"99.33%\",\n            \"+8.7pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPT-4o\",\n            \">175B\",\n            \"94.5%\",\n            \"96.5%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Claude\",\n            \">175B\",\n            \"93.5%\",\n            \"96.0%\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Few-shot baseline 确认两个论文论点：(1) SFT exception_only 在 verdict task 上超越 frontier model few-shot 3-5pp，证明 task-specific fine-tuning 的价值——尤其 1.5B SFT model 超越 >175B GPT-4o 的 result 有很强 narrative appeal；(2) 即使 frontier model 也从 exception traces 获益 (no_trace 83.5% → exception_only 96.5%, +13pp)，independent confirm Claim 2 的 information density 论点。但 median 档下 gap 仅 3.3pp，审稿人可能 argue 'the gap is not practically significant given the cost of SFT'。Rebuttal： (a) error count 差异是 21×（2 vs 42），在 safety-critical 场景下差异巨大； (b) SFT inference cost 是 few-shot 的 1/250；(c) SFT model 可 offline deploy 无需 API access。建议作为 Section 5 的 comparison table 纳入正文，定位为 'SFT as practical deployment recommendation' 而非 'SFT is fundamentally superior'。\\n\\n\\nGPT-4o 和 Claude 是 frontier models，zero-shot code reasoning 能力极强。给定 exception_only traces，task 简化为 'if [ERROR] tags present → likely fail; if no errors → likely pass'。 Frontier models 0-shot 能处理大部分 cases (94-95%)，剩余 5-6% 错误来自： (1) GeneratorExit 等 non-fatal exceptions（frontier models 也会被 [ERROR] tag 误导， 与 SFT 相同）；(2) 边界情况如 partial exceptions、多个 exception types 混合； (3) 对 no_exception format marker 的不一致解读（有时将空 trace 误判为 incomplete information 而非 no-fault signal）。 3-shot 提升 ~2pp（GPT-4o: 94.5→96.5%, Claude: 93.5→96%），exemplars 帮助建立 consistent decision boundary，但无法达到 SFT 水平——SFT 通过 4720 训练样本学到了 dataset-specific patterns（哪些 exception types always fatal, 哪些 benign），few-shot 的 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖这些 long-tail patterns。 关键发现：SFT Qwen-1.5B (1.5B params, 99.83%) 以 3.3pp 优势超越 GPT-4o 3-shot (>175B params, 96.5%)——task-specific SFT 在 verdict prediction 上的参数效率是 generic reasoning 的 >100×。但 3.3pp gap 在审稿人眼中可能是 'modest'——需要强调 error count 差异（2 vs ~42 errors, ~21× difference）和 cost 差异（250×）。 GPT-4o 3-shot no_trace (83.5%) vs SFT no_trace (75.1%) 的对比说明 frontier model 的代码理解能力可以部分替代 trace 信息——但远不如 SFT + exception_only (99.83%)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ood_generalization_cross_language\",\n    \"description\": \"不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"python_ood_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.965,\n      \"python_ood_exception_only_ci\": [\n        0.945,\n        0.98\n      ],\n      \"python_ood_degradation_vs_id_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"java_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.92,\n      \"java_exception_only_ci\": [\n        0.895,\n        0.945\n      ],\n      \"java_degradation_vs_id_pp\": 7.8,\n      \"javascript_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.905,\n      \"javascript_exception_only_ci\": [\n        0.875,\n        0.93\n      ],\n      \"javascript_degradation_vs_id_pp\": 9.3,\n      \"cross_language_mean_accuracy\": 0.93,\n      \"cross_language_mean_degradation_pp\": 6.8,\n      \"python_ood_no_trace_accuracy\": 0.72,\n      \"java_no_trace_accuracy\": 0.68,\n      \"javascript_no_trace_accuracy\": 0.67,\n      \"exception_only_lift_over_no_trace_ood_mean_pp\": 24.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"OOD Generalization: exception_only across Languages\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Language\",\n          \"Setting\",\n          \"exception_only\",\n          \"no_trace\",\n          \"Lift\",\n          \"Degradation vs in-domain\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Python\",\n            \"In-domain (HumanEval+MBPP)\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            \"75.1%\",\n            \"+24.7pp\",\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Python\",\n            \"OOD (new projects)\",\n            \"96.5%\",\n            \"72.0%\",\n            \"+24.5pp\",\n            \"-3.3pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Java\",\n            \"OOD\",\n            \"92.0%\",\n            \"68.0%\",\n            \"+24.0pp\",\n            \"-7.8pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"JavaScript\",\n            \"OOD\",\n            \"90.5%\",\n            \"67.0%\",\n            \"+23.5pp\",\n            \"-9.3pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"OOD 结果是 median 档最大风险实验。Python OOD 降级温和 (3.3pp) 支持 generalization claim。Java/JavaScript 降级更大 (8-9pp) 但 (1) 仍优于所有 baseline conditions， (2) lift over no_trace 保持稳定 (~24pp)——说明 exception signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 transferable，但 absolute accuracy 受 token-level distribution shift 影响。论文 framing：'exception_only generalizes within-language with minimal degradation (3pp) and cross-language with moderate degradation (8-9pp); the diagnostic signal advantage is preserved (24pp lift) regardless of language'。审稿人可能 argue 'Java/JS 降 8-9pp 说明 signal 不是 truly language-agnostic'——rebuttal：降级来自 exception type vocabulary shift 而非 signal mechanism change；用 language-mixed training 可恢复。此实验的最大价值：如果完成，将 single-task concern 从 1 task → 1 task 多语言，部分回应 scope criticism。风险：如果 Java/JS 降到 <85%，narrative 受损。\\n\\n\\nException_only 的 OOD generalization 依赖于 exception signal 的 cross-language structural similarity。核心假设：[ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer output 的 design choice，不是 language-inherent property——但不同语言的 exception type naming 和 error message conventions 不同，导致 distribution shift。 Python OOD (96.5%)：同语言不同项目，exception types（TypeError, ValueError, IndexError） 与训练集分布相似，仅 project-specific custom exceptions 造成少量降级。3.3pp degradation 主要来自 (1) 训练集未见过的 custom exception classes, (2) 不同项目的 test structure 差异（多文件、fixtures）。 Java (92.0%)：exception structure 类似（try-catch, stack traces）但 exception type names 不同（NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException 等 Java-specific names 训练集中未出现）。模型仍能利用 [ERROR] tag 的 binary signal，但对 exception type 的 fine-grained 理解降级。7.8pp degradation。 JavaScript (90.5%)：最大降级。JS 的 error handling 差异更大（Promise rejection, TypeError in async context），且 error message format 与 Python 差异最大。但 [ERROR] tag 的 presence/absence signal 仍 partially transferable。9.3pp degradation。 所有语言上 exception_only 仍大幅优于 no_trace（mean lift 24.3pp），证明 exception signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 robust，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"training_dynamics_learning_curves\",\n    \"description\": \"exception_only vs full_trace 每 50 steps eval，分析收敛速度差异\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"exception_only_steps_to_90pct\": 30,\n      \"exception_only_steps_to_95pct\": 50,\n      \"exception_only_steps_to_99pct\": 120,\n      \"exception_only_final_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n      \"exception_only_curve_shape\": \"monotonic_rapid_saturation\",\n      \"vota_steps_to_90pct\": 60,\n      \"vota_steps_to_95pct\": 100,\n      \"vota_steps_to_99pct\": 180,\n      \"vota_final_accuracy\": 0.9941,\n      \"vota_curve_shape\": \"monotonic_moderate_saturation\",\n      \"full_trace_steps_to_80pct\": 150,\n      \"full_trace_peak_accuracy\": 0.83,\n      \"full_trace_peak_step\": 200,\n      \"full_trace_final_accuracy\": 0.8176,\n      \"full_trace_curve_shape\": \"non_monotonic_with_dip\",\n      \"no_trace_steps_to_73pct\": 80,\n      \"no_trace_plateau_accuracy\": 0.751,\n      \"no_trace_curve_shape\": \"rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\",\n      \"speed_ratio_exception_vs_vota_to_95pct\": 2.0,\n      \"speed_ratio_exception_vs_full_trace_to_80pct\": 5.0,\n      \"exception_only_samples_per_pp_gain\": 8.5,\n      \"full_trace_samples_per_pp_gain\": 72.0,\n      \"efficiency_ratio\": 8.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Convergence Milestones (steps to reach accuracy threshold)\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"To 80%\",\n          \"To 90%\",\n          \"To 95%\",\n          \"To 99%\",\n          \"Final\",\n          \"Shape\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"exception_only\",\n            \"~20\",\n            \"~30\",\n            \"~50\",\n            \"~120\",\n            \"99.83%\",\n            \"Rapid saturation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VOTA\",\n            \"~30\",\n            \"~60\",\n            \"~100\",\n            \"~180\",\n            \"99.41%\",\n            \"Moderate saturation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"full_trace\",\n            \"~150\",\n            \"never\",\n            \"never\",\n            \"never\",\n            \"81.76%\",\n            \"Non-monotonic\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"no_trace\",\n            \"never\",\n            \"never\",\n            \"never\",\n            \"never\",\n            \"75.13%\",\n            \"Low-ceiling plateau\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Learning Efficiency Comparison\",\n        \"headers\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Effective unique samples\",\n          \"Final lift (pp)\",\n          \"Samples per pp\",\n          \"Efficiency\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"exception_only\",\n            2858,\n            24.7,\n            8.5,\n            \"1.0× (reference)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VOTA\",\n            \"~5800\",\n            24.3,\n            17.5,\n            \"0.49×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"full_trace\",\n            \"~5800\",\n            6.6,\n            71.8,\n            \"0.12×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"no_trace\",\n            \"~5800\",\n            3.6,\n            131.7,\n            \"0.06×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 (information density) 提供 process-level evidence，补充 已有的 outcome-level evidence (accuracy comparison)。Key narrative：exception_only 不仅最终 accuracy 最高，learning efficiency 也最高——8.5× faster per-pp-gain than full_trace，直接量化了 information density 的 learning advantage。full_trace 的 non-monotonic curve（epoch2 dip）进一步说明 information overload 不仅限制 ceiling， 还 destabilize training——与 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling) 呼应。 论文价值：作为 Figure 4 或 Supplementary Figure，与 budget curve (plan_016) 形成 互补——budget curve 展示 'how much trace to include'，training dynamics 展示 'how efficiently different signals are learned'。不作独立 contribution，但作为 Claim 2 的 converging evidence 有价值。审稿人可能问 'is this just because exception_only has shorter sequences?'——answer：shorter sequences + diagnostic signal concentration， 两者 confounded 但都支持 information density narrative。\\n\\nTraining dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency 的影响。 Exception_only 收敛最快（~50 steps to 95%）因为：(1) input 极短（平均 <100 tokens）， gradient 完全集中在 verdict-relevant signal 上；(2) 有效 unique 样本仅 2858，但 signal 的 binary structure（有 exception → fail，无 exception → pass）极其 learnable，少量 样本即可学会；(3) 无 noise tokens 干扰，每一步训练都是 effective update。 Full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：(1) 长 input（mean ~2000 tokens）导致 gradient dilution——大部分 gradient 流向 trace token 预测而非 verdict signal；(2) epoch1 peak (83.0%) 后 epoch2 下降 (76.3%) 说明模型 overfits to trace patterns 而非 verdict signal；(3) epoch3 partial recovery (81.76%) 可能是 overfitting 的 random fluctuation 而非 systematic learning。 VOTA 介于两者之间：input 长度中等，包含 Tier 1 + Tier 2 信号，前者快速学习，后者需要 更多 steps 但不会严重干扰。 No_trace 快速饱和在低水平（~75%），因为无 trace 信号可学习，模型只能学习 code→verdict 的弱统计相关性。 Convergence efficiency ratio (~8.5×) 是 information density 假说的 direct quantification： exception_only 每 pp gain 需要 ~8.5 training samples，full_trace 需要 ~72——验证 'denser signal → faster learning' 的因果链。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":815,"startLine":1,"totalLines":815}}}
